[{"item":{"listingUrl":"https://www.domain.com.au/24-pearson-street-balmain-east-nsw-2041-2020913613","sourceSite":"domain","externalId":"2020913613","address":"24 Pearson Street, Balmain East NSW 2041, NSW 2041","suburb":"Balmain East","state":"NSW","postcode":"2041","priceDisplay":"Buyer's Guide $16m","priceNumeric":16000000,"beds":6,"baths":6,"parking":5,"landSizeSqm":819,"propertyType":"House","agentName":null,"agencyName":"CobdenHayson Balmain","description":"Rothesay c1868 stands as one of Sydney's finest and most significant sandstone estates, a landmark residence reimagined for a new era while honouring its extraordinary architectural pedigree. Anchored to a spectacular setting at the harbour's edge, the Gothic Revival manor captures panoramic uninterrupted views across Darling Harbour and Barangaroo that sweep across to the city skyline and Anzac Bridge. A masterful restoration and reinvention has ushered in a new chapter for the estate, celebrating its rich heritage while introducing a striking contemporary narrative. Gothic Revival architecture and authentic Tudor-style details have been carefully preserved and masterfully reimagined, creating a compelling dialogue between English manor-house elegance, New York sophistication and Australian colonial character. At its heart, a glass-framed atrium links the original residence with a breathtaking harbourside pavilion where walls of glass frame creating a truly immersive experience. Double-height glass walls form the architectural centrepiece, creating a bold interplay of light, volume and scale while drawing the vista deep into the home. Reinvented for contemporary family living with views that will never be built out, the six-bedroom residence delivers a calibre of amenity rarely found in a private residence with a heated pool, whisky room, guest suite and a five-car garage.\n\n- Dress-circle peninsula setting, cinematic harbour views\n- Steeped in Australian history and masterfully reimagined\n- Approx. 819sqm land size, 740sqm internal, 500sqm external\n- Sandstone walls, polished hardwood floors, vaulted ceilings\n- 6 large bedrooms with built-ins plus an au pair/guest suite\n- 3 ensuite, master with breathtaking harbour and city views\n- Beautiful Western Red cedar joinery, stained glass windows\n- Formal lounge and dining rooms with Jetmaster fireplaces \n- Whisky room or home office, Sonos sound and ducted air\n- Custom marble kitchen anchored by a monolithic island \n- Butler's pantry/caterers kitchen, Wolf and SubZero appliances\n- Harbourside living pavilion with polished concrete floors \n- Soaring double-height ceilings, full height glass walls \n- View-swept terraces, heated pool and landscaped gardens\n- 6 luxurious bathrooms, powder room, high-end finishes \n- Internal access to a huge five-car garage and wine cellar \n\nConjunction Agents: \nMaclay Longhurst 0420 206 659 - Sotheby's International\nEmily Davidson 0437 492 378 - Sotheby's International","latitude":-33.858668,"longitude":151.1943708,"nextInspection":"2026-07-25T00:00:00.000Z"},"imageUrls":["https://rimh2.domainstatic.com.au/TgWCSOrtGY6SwE92OBWeRtP_TwU=/fit-in/1920x1080/filters:format(webp):quality(85):no_upscale()/2020913613_46_3_260612_074518-w3508-h2479","https://rimh2.domainstatic.com.au/rfy_qKBG_MLX3CVMl_-9-VvTrsM=/fit-in/1920x1080/filters:format(webp):quality(85):no_upscale()/2020913613_45_1_260616_034701-w5488-h3655","https://rimh2.domainstatic.com.au/wFXF8EqVa9VjCZUXOzfAnRoGTFs=/fit-in/1920x1080/filters:format(webp):quality(85):no_upscale()/2020913613_44_1_260616_034701-w5488-h3655","https://rimh2.domainstatic.com.au/NgexjysEny35HdkBNdixBulvN5I=/fit-in/1920x1080/filters:format(webp):quality(85):no_upscale()/2020913613_43_1_260612_074518-w7296-h4866","https://rimh2.domainstatic.com.au/ROul6ZHy9l7CaJ9F3IxQ1TiroSQ=/fit-in/1920x1080/filters:format(webp):quality(85):no_upscale()/2020913613_42_1_260612_074518-w6177-h4120","https://rimh2.domainstatic.com.au/qjGEe6XWwChmsRm5RZJJ7G9CaE8=/fit